edgement, a changed boot identity, and recovered directory behavior; lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the reboot.","limitations":["Behavior was sampled with two unprivileged system accounts rather than every possible local user, though mode 1777 and repeated direct tests provide strong general evidence.","The retained /tmp/antrieb-reboot.log is minor executor-created residue."]}
